            "text_color": "#11243e",
            "border_color": "#f0f3e9",
            "show_controls": false,
            "column_size": "3",
            "title": "",
            "heading_tag": "h2",
            "subheading": "",
            "content": "<h3>After-Hours Installation</h3><p>Camera installation scheduled outside business hours to avoid disrupting store operations. Most stores complete hardware setup in a single evening.</p><h4>2-4hrs</h4><p>Typical install time per store</p>",
            "link_url": "",
            "link_text": "",
            "link_style": "link"
          }
        },
        "item_zGNUAp": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "check",
            "icon_width": 32,
            "icon_background_type": "square",
            "icon_background": "#a0b842",
            "icon_color": "#ffffff",
            "background_color": "#ffffff",
            "text_color": "#11243e",
            "border_color": "#f0f3e9",
            "show_controls": false,
            "column_size": "3",
            "title": "",
            "heading_tag": "h2",
            "subheading": "",
            "content": "<h3>Existing System Integration</h3><p>Flow connects to your existing POS system without requiring replacement or major configuration changes. API, FTP, and CSV methods supported.</p><h4>Flexible</h4><p>Integration methods available</p>",
            "link_url": "",
            "link_text": "",
            "link_style": "link"
          }
        },
        "item_Vx6gWn": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "people",
            "icon_width": 32,
            "icon_background_type": "square",
            "icon_background": "#a0b842",
            "icon_color": "#ffffff",
            "background_color": "#ffffff",
            "text_color": "#11243e",
            "border_color": "#f0f3e9",
            "show_controls": false,
            "column_size": "3",
            "title": "",
            "heading_tag": "h2",
            "subheading": "",
            "content": "<h3>Training & Support Included</h3><p>On-site training for store managers, online resources for staff, and ongoing customer success support throughout deployment and beyond.</p><h4>Hands-On</h4><p>Implementation support</p>",
            "link_url": "",
            "link_text": "",
            "link_style": "link"
          }
        },
        "item_rqKyhB": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "check",
            "icon_width": 32,
            "icon_background_type": "square",
            "icon_background": "#a0b842",
            "icon_color": "#ffffff",
            "background_color": "#f1f5ef",
            "text_color": "",
            "border_color": "#f0f3e9",
            "show_controls": false,
            "column_size": "1",
            "title": "",
            "heading_tag": "h4",
            "subheading": "",
            "content": "<h5>Phased Rollout Supported</h5><p>Start with a pilot store or region to validate results before expanding. Flow supports phased deployment timelines that align with your operational calendar and budget planning.</p>",
            "link_url": "",
            "link_text": "",
            "link_style": "link"
          }
        }
      },
